HiddenHierarchyQ and PositiveTransverseSuppressionsQ. The full PullbackChecks \
associations are retained in the accompanying WL result file.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"aeee22c2-3103-4c42-b0b0-34ff9a905e9d"],

